{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18206220","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18206220","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:4:1820622001:0":{"text":"妈妈！是，刚刚的人！带皮普回家的人！","source_cn":"妈妈！是，刚刚的人！带皮普回家的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56E88DE7AE6F39E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1820622002:0":{"text":"人？刚刚的人？","source_cn":"人？刚刚的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE5BFFB52E3E6A93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1820622003:0":{"text":"穆婆婆，让你们也变成了动物？这么快？","source_cn":"穆婆婆，让你们也变成了动物？这么快？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33C2F943C51304C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1820622004:0":{"text":"你们果然是被穆婆婆变成这样的。她对你们做了什么？！","source_cn":"你们果然是被穆婆婆变成这样的。她对你们做了什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8E80045DCC8FDC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1820622004":{"text":"你们果然是被穆婆婆变成这样的。她对你们做了什么？！","source_cn":"你们果然是被穆婆婆变成这样的。她对你们做了什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8E80045DCC8FDC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1820622005:0":{"text":"穆婆婆帮助我们，变成动物。像我这样。","source_cn":"穆婆婆帮助我们，变成动物。像我这样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB67043156488AC0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1820622006:0":{"text":"很久以前，是亡灵，夕染村的亡灵。但是，记忆变模糊了……","source_cn":"很久以前，是亡灵，夕染村的亡灵。但是，记忆变模糊了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x370028DA2BA8B03F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1820622007:0":{"text":"城里人说要换手臂，换腿，换肋骨。可是没有那些东西。","source_cn":"城里人说要换手臂，换腿，换肋骨。可是没有那些东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF52FB80C6C8B3BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1820622008:0":{"text":"……换手臂？","source_cn":"……换手臂？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07651577B684D136","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1820622009:0":{"text":"你为瑟恩简单讲述了亡灵需要更换肢体，防止记忆和意识磨损、走向疯狂的习俗。","source_cn":"你为瑟恩简单讲述了亡灵需要更换肢体，防止记忆和意识磨损...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9E5FF6524C7E97E3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"你为瑟恩简单讲述了亡灵需要更换肢体，防止记忆和意识磨损、走向疯狂的习俗。","female":"你为瑟恩简单讲述了亡灵需要更换肢体，防止记忆和意识磨损、走向疯狂的习俗。","variant_male_record_index":"245407","variant_female_record_index":"245408","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1820622010:1":{"text":"瑟恩沉默着，很久很久才深深地、缓慢地吸了一口气。","source_cn":"瑟恩沉默着，很久很久才深深地、缓慢地吸了一口气。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3165D130BEE33BA0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"瑟恩沉默着，很久很久才深深地、缓慢地吸了一口气。","female":"瑟恩沉默着，很久很久才深深地、缓慢地吸了一口气。","variant_male_record_index":"245409","variant_female_record_index":"245410","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1820622011:0":{"text":"难怪重型武器能够轻易击杀班题斯士兵。他们的身体太过脆弱，即使身着盔甲，也很难承受住伤害。","source_cn":"难怪重型武器能够轻易击杀班题斯士兵。他们的身体太过脆弱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3825FCCDB9423D37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1820622012:0":{"text":"所以，你们曾经是夕染村的村民。但因为没有可以用于更换的肢体，只能让穆婆婆把你们都变成动物。","source_cn":"所以，你们曾经是夕染村的村民。但因为没有可以用于更换的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE81FC010FDA125CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1820622013:0":{"text":"不是，变成。但是，差不多。","source_cn":"不是，变成。但是，差不多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF12ACFDAE2E0A428","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1820622014:0":{"text":"原本的身体腐烂了，灵魂，还在。动物是新的身体。","source_cn":"原本的身体腐烂了，灵魂，还在。动物是新的身体。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EBEB97B41BB900B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1820622014":{"text":"原本的身体腐烂了，灵魂，还在。动物是新的身体。","source_cn":"原本的身体腐烂了，灵魂，还在。动物是新的身体。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EBEB97B41BB900B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1820622015:0":{"text":"灵魂转移……好像，是这个词。","source_cn":"灵魂转移……好像，是这个词。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2101F9CE693ED989","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1820622016:0":{"text":"穆婆婆，不希望我们痛苦。动物的身体，思考得很少，忘记了很多。","source_cn":"穆婆婆，不希望我们痛苦。动物的身体，思考得很少，忘记了很多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AD5C6167F33B6C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1820622017:0":{"text":"或许你也忘记了她的为人。她远没有你说的那么友善。","source_cn":"或许你也忘记了她的为人。她远没有你说的那么友善。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03BDDB9C2219BC68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1820622018:0":{"text":"你只看到现在。以前，她不是这样。","source_cn":"你只看到现在。以前，她不是这样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87DA01840930CC20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1820622019:0":{"text":"很久以前，她不会魔法，只会照顾孩子。为了我们，她才学习魔法。","source_cn":"很久以前，她不会魔法，只会照顾孩子。为了我们，她才学习魔法。","status":"matche